    "Name": "Crimson HellKite",
    "Details": "The primary loadout for the HellKite combines five ER Medium Lasers with a Large Pulse Laser for a mostly energy based loadout. Single LRM-10 with one ton of ammo provide some indirect fire capabilities.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.06</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
